# TEC PCN blockframes

Low-fidelity **blockframes** for the TEC PCN (`TEC`) case view: grey page frames and text bars for journey boards. Not screenshots and not Mermaid — page-shaped wireframes that stay editable in git.

Each frame is labelled with the screen or view name. Hover any grey block for the element it represents. Reuse the primitives when adding Batch or Exception journeys later.

